WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.784 --> 00:00:06.600
A hairstyle plays a key role in complementing your face shape.

2
00:00:06.936 --> 00:00:13.944
For a round face, volume needs to be designed to create a visual lifting effect, so the face doesn't look even rounder.

3
00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:19.872
The key is adding more volume at the crown to draw the eye up and down.

4
00:00:20.208 --> 00:00:25.944
Extending the vertical line with crown volume makes the face look slimmer and more refined.

5
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:32.520
Meanwhile, keeping volume minimal near the ears prevents the face from looking wider — that balance is the key.

6
00:00:32.856 --> 00:00:42.480
In short, an artist's carefully judged height — stretching a round face vertically — not only slims it but also makes it look younger.
